{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Orthogonal projection","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math inline\">W</span> 是有限维实或复内积空间 <span class=\"math inline\">V</span> 的线性子空间（linear subspace）。正交投影（orthogonal projection）<span class=\"math inline\">P_W:V\\to W</span> 定义为：对每个 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\in V</span>，<span class=\"math inline\">P_Wx</span> 是唯一满足</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nP_Wx\\in W,\\qquad x-P_Wx\\perp W\n</div>\n<p>的向量，其中 <span class=\"math inline\">x-P_Wx\\perp W</span> 指其与 <span class=\"math inline\">W</span> 中每个向量的内积为零。它也是 <span class=\"math inline\">W</span> 中距离 <span class=\"math inline\">x</span> 最近的向量。在标准正交坐标下，其矩阵满足 <span class=\"math inline\">P_W^2=P_W</span>、<span class=\"math inline\">P_W^*=P_W</span>。无限维 Hilbert 空间的同一定义要求 <span class=\"math inline\">W</span> 闭（closed）。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>内积</td>\n<td>inner product</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量</td>\n<td>vector</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子空间</td>\n<td>subspace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投影</td>\n<td>projection</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正交</td>\n<td>orthogonality</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵</td>\n<td>matrix</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"la.orthogonal-projection.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"la.orthogonal-projection","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"正交投影"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Orthogonal projection","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math inline\">W</span> 是有限维实或复内积空间 <span class=\"math inline\">V</span> 的线性子空间（linear subspace）。正交投影（orthogonal projection）<span class=\"math inline\">P_W:V\\to W</span> 定义为：对每个 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\in V</span>，<span class=\"math inline\">P_Wx</span> 是唯一满足</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nP_Wx\\in W,\\qquad x-P_Wx\\perp W\n</div>\n